  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#948;</mi></math> are the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#948;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;can be written as&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#948;</mi></math> are the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mtext>th&#160;</mtext></msup></math> roots of unity except <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p>Now, from the concept of&nbsp;roots of unity, we know</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#948;</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mtext>if</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is&#160;not&#160;a&#160;multiple&#160;of</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mtext>if</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is&#160;a&#160;multiple&#160;of</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#948;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>"
  }
